    {
      "id": "mzfsvb9",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "5. NITI Aayog"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "87ke11j",
      "content": "In 2015, the Planning Commission was replaced by NITI Aayog (National Institution for Transforming India). It acts as a policy think tank for the Government of India."
    },
    {
      "id": "fydoywo",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Functions of NITI Aayog"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "w3wj5jr",
      "content": "• Promote cooperative federalism."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "7h79832",
      "content": "• Provide policy advice to the government."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ksgd37s",
      "content": "• Promote sustainable development."
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "The Prime Minister of India serves as the Ex-Officio Chairperson of NITI Aayog.",
        "The 1st Five-Year Plan was based on the Harrod-Domar Model, while the 2nd was based on the PC Mahalanobis Model.",
        "Distinction between NITI Aayog (advisory think tank, bottom-up approach) and Planning Commission (allocated funds, top-down approach) is a high-frequency exam topic."
      ],
      "id": "g4xo67s"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ndf6j3p",
      "content": "• Encourage innovation and entrepreneurship."
    },
    {
      "id": "88drucd",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Important Facts"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "7grczir",
      "content": "• Planning Commission was established in 1950."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "7tmlb1r",
      "content": "• The First Five-Year Plan started in 1951."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "evxd29z",
      "content": "• NITI Aayog replaced Planning Commission in 2015."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "zbxy5wz",
      "content": "• Prime Minister is the Chairperson of NITI Aayog."
    }
  ],
